--- a/docs/development.md
+++ b/docs/development.md
@@ -56,6 +56,19 @@ bin/rails dev:email
 
 Under the hood, this will create or remove `tmp/email-dev.txt`.
 
+### Push Notifications
+
+Push notifications are signed with a VAPID key pair, which Ops provides as
+`VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` and `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY`. Without them, the push settings are
+disabled. To generate a pair for local development:
+
+```sh
+bin/rails web_push:key
+```
+
+Push notifications also need a secure context, so they work at
+http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006 but not at http://127.0.0.1:3006.
+
 ## SaaS gem
 
 37signals bundles Fizzy with [`fizzy-saas`](https://github.com/basecamp/fizzy/tree/main/saas), a companion gem that links Fizzy with our billing system and contains our production setup.
